g?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1741459/152e95c2-4acc-48da-a248-da7ff2566dd7.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1741459/152e95c2-4acc-48da-a248-da7ff2566dd7.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1741459/152e95c2-4acc-48da-a248-da7ff2566dd7.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Spacious Furnished 6-Bedroom Accommodation | Simbach am Inn | Near Train Station\n\nProperty Description\n\nWelcome to this spacious, fully furnished six-bedroom accommodation located on Adolf-Kolping-Straße in Simbach am Inn (84359).\n\nDesigned for comfortable and practical living, the property is particularly suitable for working professionals, corporate project teams, business travelers, families, and groups looking for well-equipped accommodation in the region.\n\nWith six separate bedrooms, a fully equipped kitchen, and dedicated workspaces in every bedroom, the property provides a convenient combination of privacy, functionality, and shared living.\n\nWhether staying for a professional assignment, a temporary relocation, or an extended visit, residents benefit from a comfortable and professionally managed living environment.\n\nProperty Features\n\n* 6 separate furnished bedrooms\n* Comfortable double beds\n* Dedicated desk or workspace in every bedroom\n* Fully equipped kitchen for everyday cooking\n* Functional layout suitable for shared accommodation\n* Space for both individual privacy and communal living\n* Suitable for professional teams, families, and groups\n* Professionally managed by mHomes\n\nThe accommodation is designed to support everyday routines, offering residents the flexibility to work, relax, and prepare meals in a practical residential setting.\n\nLocation & Transportation\n\nAddress: Adolf-Kolping-Straße, 84359 Simbach am Inn, Germany\n\nThe property is situated in Simbach am Inn, a Bavarian town directly on the Austrian border, offering convenient access to regional transport connections and neighboring Braunau am Inn.\n\nPublic Transportation\n\n* Simbach (Inn) railway station: approximately 8 minutes on foot\n* RB41 regional rail service: regional connections towards Mühldorf am Inn\n* Braunau am Inn, Austria: accessible via the nearby border crossing\n* Regional transport connections for commuting and business travel\n\nThe proximity to the railway station is particularly convenient for residents working in the surrounding region who prefer access to public transportation.\n\nIdeal for Professionals & Extended Stays\n\nThe property is especially well suited for:\n\n* Corporate teams and project workers requiring shared accommodation with separate bedrooms\n* Business travelers looking for a practical and comfortable temporary residence\n* Professionals and interns seeking furnished accommodation with dedicated workspaces\n* Families and groups who appreciate multiple bedrooms and a fully equipped kitchen\n* Visitors to the German-Austrian border region looking for a convenient residential base\n\nThe six-bedroom configuration makes the property particularly attractive for groups who want to stay together while maintaining individual sleeping and working spaces.\n\nProfessionally Managed by mHomes\n\nThis accommodation is professionally managed by mHomes, an experienced furnished housing provider offering accommodation for international professionals, corporate clients, and residents relocating for work or personal reasons.\n\nOur focus is on functional furnishings, transparent communication, and a reliable accommodation experience.\n\nA practical and comfortable place to stay in Simbach am Inn, with six private bedrooms, dedicated workspaces, and convenient regional transport connections.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"6"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"250"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":390000,"deposit":780000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"3900.00","deposit":"7800.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":15,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":20,"maxAge":40,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-11-08"}],"updated":"2026-11-08T00:16:23Z","__utId__":"ut1741459"}]